      "text": "“.. AI companies are privately gaming out scenarios for a public and political revolt after a catastrophic AI event .. most likely a cyberattack, that shuts down access to financial services, internet connectivity, or even power and water.”\n\n@axios.com \nwww.axios.com/2026/10/09/a...",
