      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "a guy found a planet 117 light years away using Claude Code with Opus 5.5 & Fable\n\nNASA gave him telescope time to acquire better proof\n\nThe agents used traditional astronomy tools for processing, search, transit fitting, and false positive checks\n\nwww.reddit.com/r/ClaudeAI/c...",
